  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Regional Stabilisation Facility (RSF) is a rapid-response mechanism that relevant authorities can implement in concert with military operations. This action will contribute to strengthening community safety and security and rule of law, thereby reducing the impact of local conflict in the LCB, in particular its borderland areas. More specifically, this action aims to strengthen presence and capacities of security actors while strengthening LCBC coordination capacities to coordinate actions in borderlands. The RSF will continue to place a strong emphasis on conflict sensitivity and gender.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
